# Machine-readable reference for this software (https://citation-file-format.github.io/).
# GitHub turns it into the "Cite this repository" button with APA and BibTeX.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ulg or the UrbanSens Ecological Vector Style for a map, a plan, a report, a tender or a
  paper, please cite it as below and mention UrbanSens (https://urbansens.de/).
type: software
title: "Urban Landscape Graphics (ulg): the UrbanSens Ecological Vector Style as a library"
abstract: >-
  One catalog of colours, lightly hand-drawn textures and symbols for urban landscape maps - lawns and
  meadows, trees, water, pavings, land use, planning status - tied to German and European standards, with
  renderers for Python and exporters for QGIS, GeoServer, MapLibre and design tools.
authors:
  - name: "UrbanSens"
    website: "https://urbansens.de/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/UrbanSens/Urban-Landscape-Graphics"
url: "https://urbansens.github.io/Urban-Landscape-Graphics/"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-30"
keywords:
  - GIS
  - cartography
  - landscape architecture
  - urban ecology
  - map style
  - symbology
  - QGIS
  - MapLibre
